  "body": "Premium family living in a setting you’ll love.\r\n\r\nOpportunities to secure a home of this scale and lifestyle appeal in Campbells Bay are increasingly rare. Set on a substantial freehold section in a peaceful cul-de-sac, 4 Centennial Place offers an outstanding combination of generous family living and room to adapt as life evolves.\r\nDesigned for both everyday living and entertaining, the home features multiple living areas, well-proportioned bedrooms and excellent storage throughout. Solid brick and cedar construction provides lasting appeal, while the flexible layout offers options for growing families, teenagers or guests.\r\n\r\nWhat you’ll love about 4 Centennial Place:\r\n•Substantial freehold home with solid brick and cedar exterior\r\n•Four bedrooms, three living areas, two bathrooms and a guest WC\r\n•Versatile rumpus room with kitchenette, ideal for additional living or a potential fifth bedroom\r\n•Well-appointed kitchen with breakfast bar and quality European appliances\r\n•North-facing entertaining deck with bifold doors and awning \r\n•Master suite with private balcony, walk-in wardrobe and ensuite featuring a jacuzzi bath\r\n•Double carpeted internal-access garage, additional storage and workshop space\r\n•EV charger and generous off-street parking including a boat or campervan\r\n•Separate laundry for added convenience and practicality\r\n•Excellent storage throughout, including a built-in wine cellar\r\n\r\nThe kitchen, dining and living areas connect seamlessly through bifold doors to the sunny, north-facing deck, creating an inviting setting for relaxed afternoons and entertaining friends and family. The outlook across Pupuke Golf Course adds another dimension to the living room, while the master bedroom enjoys its own elevated perspective, with a private balcony providing a peaceful place to start or end the day.\r\n\r\nBeyond the home, established trees, landscaped gardens and vegetable patch create a private, inviting outdoor environment with space to unwind and enjoy the changing seasons.\r\n\r\nThe location is equally appealing, with Centennial Reserve at the end of the street, beautiful beaches, local shops and everyday amenities close by. Families will appreciate zoning for Campbells Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Westlake Boys and Girls High Schools, and Rangitoto College.\r\n\r\nA home that brings together space, outlook and lifestyle in one of Campbells Bay’s most desirable settings. Discover the possibilities at 4 Centennial Place, your next chapter starts here. Contact us today for a private viewing or we look forward to meeting you at the open home.\r\n\r\nTo be sold by way of Auction (unless sold prior), 1.30pm, Thursday 3rd November, Bayleys Corner 2 - 8 Northcroft Street, Takapuna, Auckland",
